，造成60人死亡、175人受伤」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.mem.gov.cn/gk/jytabljggk/zxwytadfzy/2022zx/202301/t20230119_440918.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.mem.gov.cn/gk/jytabljggk/zxwytadfzy/2022zx/202301/t20230119_440918.shtml"]},"；应急管理部 (2025). 2025年1月15日新闻发布会：「火灾起数同比下降42.2%，伤亡人数下降超过90%」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.mem.gov.cn/xw/xwfbh/2025n01y15xwfbh_6337/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.mem.gov.cn/xw/xwfbh/2025n01y15xwfbh_6337/"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2021-08/01/content_5628815.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["打开来源链接"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["别买改装电池，别用杂牌充电器，别整夜充着不管。锂电池一旦起火，几十秒里就整片烧开，同时冒出剧毒的烟。车停在楼道里起火，烧的就是你唯一的逃生通道。应急管理部公布的数字是，2021 年全国电动自行车火灾 1.8 万起，死 65 人。其中烧在建筑物里的 3782 起，死了 60 人，死者几乎都在室内。2024 年整治之后，火灾起数比上年降了 42.2%，伤亡降了九成以上，那一年的绝对数没有公布。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag"